        "episode_id": "ep-2a703b6f57d9020f",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. Where do dive planning and wreck diving intersect?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:70821dd91a72ad37",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1056,
        "char_start": 892,
        "episode_id": "ep-2a703b6f57d9020f",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Honestly, Silt-out from poor finning technique kills more divers in wrecks than equipment failures. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
